---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Governance">
  <section class="wrap section">
    <p class="eyebrow">Governance</p>
    <h1>Rules you can fork</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Our governance lives in the repository as a versioned file. Every rule change is a pull
      request with public discussion and an audit trail. If you disagree with how this community
      is run, you can propose a change — or fork the whole thing, rules included.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:2.5rem">The contribution ladder</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-2" style="margin-top:1.2rem">
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Learner</h3>
        <p>Anyone using the school or registry. No account needed, no data collected.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Contributor</h3>
        <p>One merged pull request. You get a contributor page and a vote on non-binding polls.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Maintainer</h3>
        <p>Five merged PRs plus a sponsor from an existing maintainer. Review rights in a content area via CODEOWNERS.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Steward</h3>
        <p>Elected annually by maintainers. Holds admin rights, breaks ties, and is accountable to a public record of decisions.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <h2 style="margin-top:3rem">Commitments we hold ourselves to</h2>
    <div class="card" style="margin-top:1.2rem">
      <ul style="margin:0;padding-left:1.2rem;line-height:2">
        <li>Every artifact on this platform stays under an OSI- or CC-approved open license.</li>
        <li>No user tracking, no advertising, no selling of data — ever, under any funding pressure.</li>
        <li>Decisions that affect contributors happen in public before they happen in private.</li>
        <li>We publish our real median PR review time, including when it's bad.</li>
        <li>If this project dies, the repo stays public and forkable. Nothing is trapped.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <p style="margin-top:2rem">
      Full text: <a href="https://github.com/unite4ai/unite4ai.github.io/blob/main/GOVERNANCE.md">GOVERNANCE.md</a> ·
      <a href="https://github.com/unite4ai/unite4ai.github.io/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md">Code of Conduct</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
